        "notes": "Async generator declarations, expressions, object methods, and class methods materialize as generated non-constructable JsFunctionObject instances. Every call creates an independent AsyncGeneratorScope and AsyncGeneratorObject while retaining shared lexical captures and the call-time receiver. Parameter binding runs synchronously when called. Native Test262 coverage verifies 618 expression cases and 300 statement/declaration cases, including parameter destructuring, defaults, grammar, iterator delegation, restricted properties, with/unscopables, function identity, and return/throw completion behavior. Five expression cases and one declaration case remain unsupported because they require eval. Full cross-realm/brand conformance is not claimed."
      },
