        "notes": "Ordinary yield expressions await their operands before suspending with a promise-wrapped iterator result. Delegated yield* awaits the iterator result but preserves its value without unwrapping promises supplied by a manually implemented async iterator; sync iterator fallback performs the required value unwrapping."
      },
