          "test/language/statements/async-generator/yield-star-throw-notdone-iter-value-throws.js"
        ],
        "notes": "An explicit return expression is awaited even when its value is undefined; a bare return or normal body fallthrough completes without that extra await. Await-result fields are planned consistently for declarations, expressions, dynamic functions, and methods. Synchronous delegated-protocol and value-getter exceptions route to the surrounding generator catch/finally state without placing suspension inside a CLR exception region."
      },
